    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797050/extras/3dfebf875ebb1b160da2360773d3e407.poster.avif?t=1720918590\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797050/extras/3dfebf875ebb1b160da2360773d3e407.webm?t=1720918590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797050/extras/3dfebf875ebb1b160da2360773d3e407.mp4?t=1720918590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Q. What kind of game?</h2>Swing Scale is a game that uses centrifugal force to explore various worlds and aim upward.<br>Adjust the length of the wire, adjust the speed, and push the limits.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797050/extras/f3d86518fe0660dd453aa7490a2166e0.poster.avif?t=1720918590\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797050/extras/f3d86518fe0660dd453aa7490a2166e0.webm?t=1720918590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797050/extras/f3d86518fe0660dd453aa7490a2166e0.mp4?t=1720918590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Q: How to play?</h2><strong>Controls are simple!</strong><br>Left-click to shoot the wire.<br>Use the A or D keys to gain momentum.<br>Click again to release the wire.<br>Using the hook consumes gauge, reducing the distance the wire can travel. When the gauge reaches zero, the hook can no longer be launched.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797050/extras/3dfebf875ebb1b160da2360773d3e407.poster.avif?t=1720918590\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797050/extras/3dfebf875ebb1b160da2360773d3e407.webm?t=1720918590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797050/extras/3dfebf875ebb1b160da2360773d3e407.mp4?t=1720918590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Q. What kind of game?</h2>Swing Scale is a game that uses centrifugal force to explore various worlds and aim upward.<br>Adjust the length of the wire, adjust the speed, and push the limits.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797050/extras/f3d86518fe0660dd453aa7490a2166e0.poster.avif?t=1720918590\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797050/extras/f3d86518fe0660dd453aa7490a2166e0.webm?t=1720918590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797050/extras/f3d86518fe0660dd453aa7490a2166e0.mp4?t=1720918590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Q: How to play?</h2><strong>Controls are simple!</strong><br>Left-click to shoot the wire.<br>Use the A or D keys to gain momentum.<br>Click again to release the wire.<br>Using the hook consumes gauge, reducing the distance the wire can travel. When the gauge reaches zero, the hook can no longer be launched.",
